"<CLT 4>I don't have anything to do here. I need to hurry and\nget to the dining hall!\n<CLT>"
msgstr ""
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have anything to do here. I need to hurry and\n"
"get to the dining hall!\n"
"<CLT>"
